{"name":"Wash Me","hex":"#fafbfd","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"wash","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To clean with water.","To carry away or erode by the force of water in motion."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The process or an instance of washing or being washed by water or other liquid.","A liquid used for washing."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wash"}],"entries":[{"title":"Reverse graffiti","blocks":[{"text":"Reverse graffiti is a method of creating temporary or semi-permanent images on walls or other surfaces by removing dirt from a surface. It can also be done by simply removing dirt with the fingertip from windows or other dirty surfaces, such as writing \"wash me\" on a dirty vehicle. Others, such as graffiti artist Moose, use a cloth or a high-power washer to remove dirt on a larger scale."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Reverse-graffiti_Piratenpartei_Bayreuth_%2801%29.jpg/330px-Reverse-graffiti_Piratenpartei_Bayreuth_%2801%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reverse_graffiti","wikidata":"Q1810315"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Dirty_van.jpg/500px-Dirty_van.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Dirty_van.jpg/500px-Dirty_van.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Not even as dirty as an MP's expenses!\" written on the back doors of a van, using a fingertip","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADirty_van.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Reversegraffiti_moose_sf.jpg/500px-Reversegraffiti_moose_sf.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Reversegraff